# Team TenaCity

## About the Game

Team TenaCity is a serious game crafted to enhance team relationships and resilience within intact teams across the Singapore Public Service. [Click here](https://go.gov.sg/team-tenacity-research) to download the research paper and learn more!

> **Get Creative!** We encourage teams to create their own gameplay variants using the components provided (including the dice). Share your innovative gameplay ideas with ILOD at [ilod@cscollege.gov.sg](mailto:ilod@cscollege.gov.sg) and we might feature them on this page!

